    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6b246f7aa640d08a249ccfb0",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "新宇宙要参加经典三冠。\r\n因为……那里会遇到“劲敌”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a5b43c5b6ef722432612f1a6108d831805b09ad30305426fe8cbcd4229b571d6",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
