    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:728e0636839c7747d52616f5",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "新宇宙",
      "source_fingerprint": "f4d688f71d8c38a8a2d9ef98cb402b044f0892dc958bfddf71ec65b7b37fbf2f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1105/storytimeline_501105115.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        67,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/67/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:984fac5c9cf81e8bd7b97e27",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "未曾接触过的——劲敌。\r\n而且，\r\n荒漠英雄似乎也在准备参加『日本德比』。",
      "source_fingerprint": "720784613b7212ddf6f8749a69be3902cbbb1b30027c142cd37f85a3d182f6e1",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1105/storytimeline_501105115.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        67,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/67/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bf570933b216a54f8d2dc7b2",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我们将迷惘抛在脑后——\r\n接下来，只要向着经典三冠冲刺就好了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ca9b6590c0710467c8ed6cb5566e328e31ae5dc9ae287c4271c028ed657768d9",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1105/storytimeline_501105115.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        68,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/68/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5b54d6f1fad5962e23b98efb",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "首先是『皋月赏』。\r\n我们会以此为起点，\r\n向着明年的“GATE”加速前进。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0cee919592206b2948873f87a65e1bb51b1a2cc709730973cde60bd9c2cdc96e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1105/storytimeline_501105115.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        69,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/69/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:eb7c0db35dca051d5ab5793c",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "荒漠英雄",
      "source_fingerprint": "aaf6b29d17c0d17b31649773a41c9995f963b5bb8c45fb8d89c79c740e5bc158",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1105/storytimeline_501105115.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        7,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/7/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:90942387aa7e4ebba0839eca",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "诶诶，训练员？\r\n哎……请……请您不要突然哭起来呀……\r\n求你了，先别哭了好吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "0a51c88a8813cbd903968c9acb93d6915c6d9a301851cd1e672b7cab17fcd2e0",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1105/storytimeline_501105115.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        7,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/7/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f3158b409c3cad069403417f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "——调查毫无进展。\r\n我无论如何都找不到任何记载着“SETO”的\r\n文献——甚至是与其有关的只言片语都找不到。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5e76a826c3f446bea94e3be71c185e84372d77a86d72c8a2117ca72ca0df4960",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1105/storytimeline_501105115.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        8,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/8/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8e14ea244db5507af3ac1846",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……既然如此，就从别的方向着手调查吧。\r\n关于那所谓“通往最强之路”——",
      "source_fingerprint": "6da47aca668c93f231870723f79063556f2dc54fcf3b3fbdcafb5fa6f3a5a6f5",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1105/storytimeline_501105115.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        9,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/9/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ce47a46f3e3357052ae2b448",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "“SETO”を継ぐ者",
      "source_fingerprint": "6024e144e4a7c2836885e7355b7bffc02f0134a20856264b6a45240c57eb0c82",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1105/storytimeline_501105115.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:041dc7da1855e4d54a723641",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "——岁末。虽说人们大多认为该在这时候忘却\r\n一年的烦恼尽情享受新年，但说实话……",
      "source_fingerprint": "cc2c30112d7d0d3789b59592115a1cea9be3ed9facc2524120f8e39e8edd5ba6",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1105/storytimeline_501105116.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:41ce9e47ff8adee305b5e46c",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "有些事情，实在是想忘都忘不了。\r\n比如——",
      "source_fingerprint": "29b9700772091001d96f64c0f20276ba87bc8c72ae86e375d2941700cb274dc4",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1105/storytimeline_501105116.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4c5afe94bb0fcac80562c246",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "成绩不振、体能不再的赛马娘多会选择退役，\r\n回归平凡的生活。\r\n其他可能性的话——",
      "source_fingerprint": "dff6abfb3c76ff029c99e2e935913cd750fc8bc315ced5799585cfea83799302",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1105/storytimeline_501105116.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        10,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/10/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:855d9d44135b6028d26b1be2",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "（咚咚　咚咚……）",
      "source_fingerprint": "10536354ca78071c197e3754af3fc06966bf801950a8497564630a3f887786f9",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1105/storytimeline_501105116.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        11,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/11/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cceb6a6122ce28c617dff997",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "——“失踪”。\r\n虽然我很不愿这样想……\r\n但这种可能性并不是不存在。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e652325c42687bb317dc7637853a68040449be52c933abca7ea102c519938c7e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1105/storytimeline_501105116.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        12,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/12/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:108396ccb53aa1e74d615b4d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "有些赛马娘会对无法获胜的自己产生极端厌恶，\r\n接着为逃避现实而独自离开，去到一个没人认识\r\n她的地方……",
      "source_fingerprint": "4bbe7c8c40d4ab7c7328f2bad5aa8802bd2b28afa708b96e25a2c36c09592a01",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1105/storytimeline_501105116.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        13,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/13/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:72513357b40f6147c14be57a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "但是……这些可能性也被我一一否决。\r\n新宇宙说出“消失”这个词的时候……\r\n那低沉的感觉，总让我感觉有种违和感。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3e6afa3611bce41bee642e858c94d7dd68fb2c0c12f7fd4abe4389aceb78314d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1105/storytimeline_501105116.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        14,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/14/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8a54b9456902862cac16775d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我再度来到图书馆查阅文献。\r\n就算只是假说也好，有没有什么线索……",
      "source_fingerprint": "1e5d9407b02cfe29630bf2292e6ebd33dd68b5c5300eb4edcc6bfc9f6902f259",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1105/storytimeline_501105116.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        15,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/15/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:507f607414498ec2b3fd169f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "荒漠英雄……",
      "source_fingerprint": "fe5781f0be6a431a01d60db61d974c2b055b062a6377b4283fee0df4f60d93fb",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1105/storytimeline_501105116.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        16,
        "choice_data_list",
        0
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/16/choice_data_list/0"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:55b01d98d774a63cce48111a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "荒漠英雄",
      "source_fingerprint": "aaf6b29d17c0d17b31649773a41c9995f963b5bb8c45fb8d89c79c740e5bc158",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1105/storytimeline_501105116.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        16,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/16/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4875c6f249c5324db300c00c",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "那个……训练员？\r\n您在查什么东西吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "4c83af3e3ca7c4fbdf0a9705697000053d5569d10202ab848a3fb17f3d710937",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1105/storytimeline_501105116.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        16,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/16/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ea04bb4bf8dd2e8ee24d47db",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "荒漠英雄",
      "source_fingerprint": "aaf6b29d17c0d17b31649773a41c9995f963b5bb8c45fb8d89c79c740e5bc158",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1105/storytimeline_501105116.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        17,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/17/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ebebc49a755728bac2b7fa79",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "不好意思，打扰您了。\r\n但是，呃……\r\n要是有什么地方是我能帮上忙的话……",
      "source_fingerprint": "2e319caf6694be25a3852e913a83f41b92bd02d7d590208f231f665996f548df",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1105/storytimeline_501105116.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        17,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/17/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a71eaaae4b8a43717e2fb94f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "说起来……每当我需要调查什么情报时，\r\n荒漠英雄总是能助我一臂之力呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a77e046ccd1fb9d8e79d308efe2356ad707a27a0cc35e94045d2e860861e7ac1",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1105/storytimeline_501105116.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        18,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/18/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c1f181d615d33245ae69c4f4",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "于是，我将情况告诉了荒漠英雄——\r\n当然，隐去了新宇宙能够观测平行宇宙的事\r\n情，只询问了她平行宇宙与消失的线索。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4dcf8fe3ff4b538057c020e572107e6a9d4e96d1f343e81b37ec5044cc99bf01",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1105/storytimeline_501105116.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        19,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/19/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3960f17764d188079553e57b",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "新宇宙",
      "source_fingerprint": "f4d688f71d8c38a8a2d9ef98cb402b044f0892dc958bfddf71ec65b7b37fbf2f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1105/storytimeline_501105116.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
