    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f005b6819ddee9cf3493193f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "既然是通过“某种东西”才能进行观测……\r\n也许，那个“东西”受到了什么影响吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "e00ba17ad899e5f32198f17daafc1528789eb6d6b4314b957d71d1050a28ffb2",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
