    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7243645b8e4adba05c8c6642",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "因为受到了影响，所以通过“那个东西”进行观\r\n测的时候，才会感觉好像是消失了一样……",
      "source_fingerprint": "84e9da72d0086335405040859fd2028b152ff02344c9872805a04245f404036d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
