      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我大概理解了她的意思。\r\n也许是因为某种原因遭到了过滤，\r\n所以才会注意不到其存在。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6975e0fc43451841e243d57ea210fde736901cbdcd6ba8da5815c0653f0cfabb",
